168263,"title":"妈妈是神队友第四季","category":"海外剧","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261126-1/10175489e291d5765881b5734bb52122.jpg","year":"2026","area":"巴西","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/26/7yiNzRMctY96/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202611/26/kMvTHMHUUF91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202611/26/6Fr3hA9vAS94/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202611/26/fpJGyySLW792/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_b0530fdf5f_part1.json"},{"id":168262,"title":"逆位恋人","category":"韩国剧","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/b07c9e3051a04ecbe1c7ee012be3ad9b.jpg","year":"2026","area":"韩国","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>暂无剧情简介</p>","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202611/25/pS7apn89Sq87/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_a394da6525_part1.json"},{"id":168261,"title":"密探2025国语","category":"剧情片","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/2a624c37ec3ed8a3a00795257a7f2ced.jpg","year":"2025","area":"巴西,法国,德国,荷兰","actor":"罗尼·韦列拉,乌多·基尔,伊萨贝尔·祖拉,瓦格纳·马拉,艾米拉·盖德斯,马丽娅·费尔南达·康基多,托马斯·阿基诺,鲁本斯·桑托斯,布达·里拉,加布里埃尔·利昂纳,爱丽丝·卡瓦略,苏茜·洛佩斯,若昂·维托尔·席尔瓦,卢西亚诺·基罗利,吉米·阿斯特利,罗贝里奥·迪奥热内斯,伊戈尔·德·阿劳若,塔尼娅·玛丽亚,劳拉·卢费西,吉安妮·阿尔布开克","director":"小克莱伯·门多萨","content":"<p>1977年，在被军事独裁统治折磨的巴西，四十多岁的马塞洛逃离了他混乱的过去，来到累西腓，希望在这里建立新的生活并与家人重修旧好。然而，他并未料到死亡威胁如影随形，笼罩在他的头顶。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"HD","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/zPmF9WztAJ97/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_dddbfb9bdd_part1.json"},{"id":168260,"title":"11月25日 26-27赛季NBANBA杯 活塞VS魔术","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/55e1fd1589dccffa0548f613c1564dec.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/iW6zGBHPZr89/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_ea2eed1fb5_part1.json"},{"id":168259,"title":"11月25日 26-27赛季NBANBA杯 凯尔特人VS奇才","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/00b8297364cc5b99c7c3dcda746327d1.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202611/25/bXgBeWkcsD91/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_ea2eed1fb5_part1.json"},{"id":168258,"title":"11月25日 26-27赛季NBANBA杯 独行侠VS掘金","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/1c82738ebaee488791fc261e80125af4.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/25/zKAijy2WXs94/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_ea2eed1fb5_part1.json"},{"id":168257,"title":"一切如你所见","category":"纪录片","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/e9e13d1db569f278a2271cdea77de70e.jpg","year":"2026","area":"美国","actor":"阿曼达·塞弗里德,克里斯托弗·阿波特,加里·维尔姆斯,内森·菲尔德,伊丽莎白·霍姆斯,菲利普·安德瑞·波铁洛,兰斯·奥本海姆,比利·埃文斯,尼克·乔克西","director":"内森·菲尔德,兰斯·奥本海姆","content":"<p>距离入狱服刑还有34天，血液检测公司Theranos创始人伊丽莎白·霍姆斯邀请摄制组走进自己的生活，允许他们记录她的一举一动。内森·菲尔德与兰斯·奥本海姆带着疑问，将镜头对准这位因欺诈获罪的硅谷创业者，以及她与伴侣、孩子相处的日常。原本围绕入狱前生活展开的人物记录，逐渐演变为一场历时三年的复杂追寻，触及真实、欺骗，以及镜头能否让人真正认识另一个人的问题。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"HD","url":"https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202611/25/LfGeSRDimm93/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_c69a1c5423_part1.json"},{"id":168256,"title":"爱情岛澳大利亚第八季","category":"欧美综艺","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/9e6b08e6e57e53526f55cea685c98390.jpg","year":"2026","area":"澳大利亚","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202611/25/BARsxtd2gN91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/25/BFHPwJSgMp96/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202611/25/CMsHixzWFZ94/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202611/25/pXLqAPM6Eh86/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/q26DQNjuKf92/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202611/25/yAntm4dmGd90/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202611/25/rUVz2AMLaJ87/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202611/25/eQqw00WNc589/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/25/SUkQWBQAU997/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202611/25/73wmAtDtxc88/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/zq4hPtzngU87/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/iA9rcuFTUV89/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202611/25/xU2fVPUvba94/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_9844a6c9ba.json"},{"id":168255,"title":"杨澜访谈录2026","category":"大陆综艺","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/958eaae7a964267829332891bf433523.jpg","year":"2026","area":"中国大陆","actor":"陈冲,郭帆,王传君,王力宏,杨澜,蔡皋,程乐松","director":"","content":"<p>从“追逐高光”到“回望来路”，和杨澜一起开启一场与时代同行的深度人文对话。郭帆、程乐松、蔡皋、王力宏、王传君、陈冲六位时代人物，六面精神镜像，一场慢下来的相遇，让我们跳出喧嚣倍速，共同打捞时光的重量。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"20261125","url":"https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202611/25/ZEmgykR5DZ88/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_235f2faded_part1.json"},{"id":168254,"title":"银翼杀手2099","category":"美国剧","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/976983ed00acad480522cd2acb571771.jpg","year":"2026","area":"美国 \\/ 捷克","actor":"杨紫琼,亨特·莎弗,迪米特里·阿博尔德,刘易斯·格里本,马修·尼达姆,凯特琳·罗斯·道尼,丹尼尔·里格比,约翰尼·哈里斯,艾米·伦诺克斯,希拉·阿蒂姆,汤姆·伯克,毛里齐奥·隆巴迪,威尔·柯班,Alexandra,Russo,Hugo,Hamlet,弗朗西斯·洛夫霍尔,哈桑·纳吉布,安德鲁·范·威尔普,朱莉安娜·亚兹贝克,约翰·阿迪森,杜夫·麦克唐纳德","director":"乔纳森·范塔勒肯","content":"<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在《银翼杀手2049》事件发生五十年后，洛杉矶已焕然一新，只是这并非出自人类之手。Cora是一名逃犯，为了彻底结束逃亡生活，她化身“银翼杀手”，这是她最后一次身份转变。Cora被迫与距离死亡仅剩数日的复制人Olwen搭档，共同追捕一名在逃者——此人隐藏的真相足以摧毁这座脆弱的城市。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202611/25/rtir1jNx0c88/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202611/25/5iUS50z4zH89/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202611/25/sjUcABYytU97/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202611/25/umqGmnC00m90/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202611/25/ZM6rcXn7si90/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/25/iVkaFMMH1M94/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202611/25/0RM5F9yd1Y86/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202611/25/K8srf4gPTA90/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f40a58533_part1.json"},{"id":168253,"title":"值得2026","category":"美国剧","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261125-1/e64536a550f48e14fd4231266875ad35.jpg","year":"2026","area":"英国","actor":"维托里奥·安格隆,汉娜·麦克莱恩,伯纳黛特·布朗,乔安妮·克劳福德,法兰·摩根,李·斯诺德格拉斯,菲斯·阿拉比,约翰·莫法特","director":"David,Moody","content":"<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Francis (Vittorio Angelone) and Sinead (Hannah McClean) are two support workers doing their best to care for their clients, if not always each other. Newcomer Sinead is an unstoppable force of positivity and idealism, old hand Francis the immovable object of reality and pragmatism.</p>","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202611/25/tSfB3SVDJZ92/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/WcE4danLZU93/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202611/25/6SVz11BBbZ94/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202611/25/FDfTjLVv7w89/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202611/25/7WBGYCkqgh93/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202611/25/fzmJAspSKT91/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f40a58533_part1.json"},{"id":168252,"title":"天地男儿2026","category":"国产剧","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261126-1/44b07c1da72c91a38f93be897ca6e6c9.jpg","year":"2026","area":"中国大陆","actor":"马可,方悦乔","director":"李抒航","content":"<p>刚过而立之年的古臻破产又遭遇妻子背叛，走投无路。可就在他会老宅处理旧物时，意外发现了一本老旧的笔记本。通过笔记本，他竟可以与20年前另一个陷入绝境的男人取得联系。一个大胆的跨时空双逆袭念头在两人脑海中出现。而这一场时空逆袭和救赎，远没有想象的那么简单。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/25/bC8hG1rRSd87/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202611/25/cTeUZ1gQnT95/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202611/25/Lkpfwme5zn97/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202611/25/264C8S91UA95/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202611/25/fgwPD4NrgF88/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202611/25/jrCm6yx0D691/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202611/25/K7JHkJC7v792/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202611/25/mWuygjxeZX96/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/ahiRUMTcsF94/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202611/25/VPKbXVUq9697/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/YTKEfA5A8G92/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/25/PzDjBsN9Ui95/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202611/26/JMrVgmfM5d97/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202611/26/tbpiNKfk4X93/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202611/26/f3J9UZHQ2E95/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202611/2