68235,"title":"11月24日 26-27赛季NBA常规赛 爵士VS湖人","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261124-1/bc2ad472ec269458c33d1b4e80ad8dde.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202611/24/EN3WgABCdb95/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_ea2eed1fb5_part1.json"},{"id":168234,"title":"妖街皇后","category":"港台三级","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261124-1/2ed7f238951b236f223a9f87f3d36fef.jpg","year":"1995","area":"新加坡,中国香港","actor":"黎氏侠,林伟亮","director":"杨凡","content":"<p>17岁的莲本是马来西亚一个富家女仆，天真无邪。然而无忧无虑的生活很快便被打了个粉碎，莲被送到了紧挨着新加坡的Bugis街上的一家小酒店做工。在这条住满了人妖的街上，莲从各人的生存打拼中开始慢慢懂得了生活的含义。本片透过一个天真无邪的十六岁女孩的眼睛去看这个光怪陆离悲与欢的地方。她未曾见过世面，纯情且天真，为着生活，只好到一间破落的酒店做下人，给她遇上各式各样的人， 其中不乏美男女.....</p>","episodes":[{"name":"HD","url":"https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202611/24/7ErfMWaHzi86/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_8ad97a66eb_part1.json"},{"id":168233,"title":"11月24日 26-27赛季NBA常规赛 篮网VS森林狼","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261124-1/0f13e14b1c72a772d469b86e66885dae.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202611/24/taGP29KnbD96/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_ea2eed1fb5_part1.json"},{"id":168232,"title":"11月24日 26-27赛季NBA常规赛 灰熊VS黄蜂","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261124-1/a28a155015542872a30f53424134b91a.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202611/24/3jtkAH2gCL88/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_ea2eed1fb5_part1.json"},{"id":168231,"title":"11月24日 26-27赛季NBA常规赛 雄鹿VS猛龙","category":"篮球","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261124-1/72b2766b9099cc57a2b911df6352bf8c.png","year":"2026","area":"大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"国语","url":"https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202611/24/G2AQHB8Uza9